[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0001","text":"孩子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0010","text":"好可怕……！！妈妈……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0020","text":"…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0030","text":"（啊啊啊糟糕了……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0040","text":"不可怕的，没事的！\n这个大姐姐是你的伙伴！当然我也是！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0050","text":"对吧！？\n——来，咲耶也！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0060","text":"！\n啊，啊啊——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0070","text":"请不要害怕！\n我们只是不想让你一个人……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0080","text":"呜，呜呜……真的吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0090","text":"是真的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0100","text":"——……\n…………谢谢你们……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20600300_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
